===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{senseid|en|noun}} {{lb|en|grammar}} {{ellipsis of|en|noun substantive|nodot=1}} or {{clipping of|en|substantive noun|notext=1|nodot=1}}; a [[noun]] or a group of words (a [[noun phrase]]) that act as a noun (in a [[sentence]]). {{defdate|from 16th c.}}
#: {{syn|en|noun|q1=sensu stricto|noun substantive}}
#: {{hyper|en|noun|q1=sensu lato}}
#* {{quote-book|en|author=w:Harry Holtzman; [[w:Martin S. James|Martin S[amuel] James]]|chapter=The New Plastic in Painting (1917)|title=The New Art—The New Life: The Collected Writings of {{w|Piet Mondrian}}|location=Boston, Mass.|publisher=w:G. K. Hall & Co.|year=1986|section=part I (The De Stijl Years: 1917–24)|page=27|pageurl=https://archive.org/details/newartthenewlife0000mond/page/27/mode/1up|isbn=0-8057-9957-5|passage=The Dutch verb ''beelden'' and '''substantive''' ''beelding'' signify form-giving, creation, and by extension image—as do ''gestalten'' and ''Gestaltung'' in German, where Neo-Plastic[ism] is translated as ''Die neue Gestaltung''.}}
# Part of a [[text]] that carries the [[meaning]], such as [[word]]s and their [[ordering]].
#: {{cot|en|accidental}}

